# Commits to skip when reading blame: bulk reformatting and mechanical
# renames, which change no instruction and would otherwise hide who wrote
# a line. git honours this with --ignore-revs-file, and GitHub reads it
# from the repository root by itself.
#
#   git blame --ignore-revs-file=.git-blame-ignore-revs <file>
#   git config blame.ignoreRevsFile .git-blame-ignore-revs   (once, per clone)
#
# Measured before this was written: plain blame credited Bobby Schulz with
# 14 of Margay.cpp's lines where 206 are his, and 27 of Walrus_I2C.cpp's
# where 86 keep his phrasing verbatim. That is what this file repairs.

